<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia PSC in acquisition talks.</title>
<headline>Malaysia PSC in acquisition talks.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shipbuilder PSC Industries Bhd said it is finalising details of &quot;several substantial&quot; acquisitions including the purchase of a government-owned entity that requires the government's approval.</p>
<p>In a statement, PSC said it was making the comments in connection with the suspension in trading of its shares. Its stock requoted on Friday and ended down 1.75 to 30 ringgit.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 206 2323)</p>
</text>
